# 2026-09-24 Phase 12 step 3: one real-LLM 'awm agent' run (TASK_v2 N2: single run, single task; chain evidence only, not an evaluation)
# machine: Claude Code cloud container (Linux x86_64, no GPU). OPENAI_API_KEY mapped from DEEPSEEK_API_KEY in the process env only.
# scenario: official e_commerce_33 (AgentWorldModel-1K revision dde80a0, CC-BY-4.0, Snowflake), task index 0

## why --mcp_url mode (server started by workbench env-manager) instead of --scenario auto-start
# 1. auto-start ends with shutil.SameFileError: awm/core/server.py:70-82 creates the working DB as <output_dir>/final.db,
#    then awm/core/agent.py:596-598 copies db_file_path onto <output_dir>/final.db (shutil.copy2 at :598; same file). Reproduced without an LLM:
$ uv run python -c '<call awm.core.server._prepare_database(Config(scenario="e_commerce_33", envs_load_path=..., db_schema_path=data/awm1k/gen_db.jsonl, sample_path=data/awm1k/gen_sample.jsonl), <out>) then shutil.copy2(db_file_path, <out>/final.db)>'
db_file_path: <out>/final.db | files: ['final.db', 'initial.db']
copy2 raised shutil.SameFileError : '<out>/final.db' and '<out>/final.db' are the same file
# 2. auto-start (start_server_process, awm/core/server.py:174-195) passes no --temp_server_path, so the server code is
#    written next to --envs_path (awm/core/server.py:134-138), i.e. into data/awm1k when pointed at the official data.
# 3. auto-start terminates only the launcher (awm/core/agent.py:605-612); RECON §10 Phase 2 showed the server survives.
# --mcp_url + --scenario/--task_id is an upstream-supported combination (awm/core/agent.py:398-407, 433-458): the task is
# looked up from --tasks_path, trajectory.json records scenario/task_id, and no DB is copied.

## commands
$ WORKBENCH_ENV__RUNS_DIR=data/p12/awm-runs uv run workbench env serve &          # control plane
$ uv run workbench env up e_commerce_33 --session-id p12awm                     # -> healthy, http://127.0.0.1:18100/mcp
$ OPENAI_API_KEY="$DEEPSEEK_API_KEY" uv run awm agent --scenario e_commerce_33 --task_id 0 \
    --tasks_path data/awm1k/gen_tasks.jsonl --mcp_url http://127.0.0.1:18100/mcp \
    --api_url https://api.deepseek.com --model deepseek-flash \
    --output_dir data/p12/awm-agent/e_commerce_33_task_0
# all other flags at upstream defaults (max_iterations 30, temperature 1.0, max_tokens 2048). DeepSeek ignores
# max_completion_tokens (probe P4) and runs in its default thinking mode (no extra body; use_vllm_extras is False).
$ uv run workbench env diff p12awm ; uv run workbench env down p12awm
(all commands with PYTHONPYCACHEPREFIX=$PWD/.cache/pycache)

## env-manager session (data/p12/awm-runs/p12awm/meta.json): explicit --db_path/--temp_server_path/--output_dir
